  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Diagram not to scale</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>A mass of 2.0 kg travelling at 5.0 m s<sup>−1</sup> collides with a mass of 4.0 kg travelling at 3.0 m s<sup>−1</sup>. The masses collide at right angles. They join and move together after the collision at θ to the original direction of the 2.0 kg mass.</p>\n<p>What is θ?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">34°</li><li data-label=\"B\">37°</li><li data-label=\"C\">50°</li><li data-label=\"D\">56°</li></ol>"
  },
